<title>UK: UK Jan non-EU trade deficit 398 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Jan non-EU trade deficit 398 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in mln stg)    JAN	 DEC   (PREL DEC)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			 -398	-640    (-844)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			6,357     5,968   (5,833)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			6,755     6,608   (6,677)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			    322	 317     (297)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			    401	 386     (386)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending Jan   -1,655     N/A    (-1,996)</p>
<p>NOTE - Consensus forecast 750 million stg deficit.  </p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 147.7    148.2   (149.1)</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 144.9    128.4   (124.9)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   1.5%   -0.5%    (UNCH)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps)  10.0%    8.5%    (9.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   unch   -1.5%   (-1.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps)   8.0%    6.5%    (6.0%)</p>
<p>TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Balance (mln stg)		    -276    -861   (-1,059)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)  -1.0%   -2.0%    (1.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)  -1.0%   -1.5%    (1.5%)</p>
</text>
